src/services/credentialStorage.ts.fix:
Run each removal independently so one failure can't block the others:

static async clearCredentials(): Promise<void> {
  await Promise.allSettled([
    SecureStore.deleteItemAsync(CREDENTIALS_KEY),
    AsyncStorage.removeItem(REMEMBER_ME_KEY),
    AsyncStorage.removeItem('@asankary_remember_email'),
  ]);
}

Promise.allSettled guarantees all three are attempted regardless of individual rejections and never throws, preserving the intended best-effort semantics while actually clearing every artifact.

